sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as FireFly API Route
    participant Cache as Token Cache
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant DBX as Databricks OAuth

    Note over App,DBX: SPN OAuth Token Exchange (M2M Flow)

    App->>Cache: Check for valid token

    alt Token exists and valid
        Cache-->>App: Return cached token
    else Token missing or expired
        App->>DB: Get SPN credentials
        Note right of DB: byodDatabricksSpns table
        DB-->>App: clientId, clientSecret (encrypted)

        App->>App: Decrypt client secret

        App->>DBX: POST /oidc/v1/token
        Note right of App: Authorization: Basic base64(clientId:clientSecret)
        Note right of App: Body: grant_type=client_credentials&scope=all-apis

        DBX->>DBX: Validate credentials
        DBX->>DBX: Generate access token

        DBX-->>App: Token Response
        Note left of DBX: access_token, token_type, expires_in

        App->>Cache: Store token with TTL
        Note right of Cache: TTL = expires_in - 60 (buffer)

        App-->>App: Return access token
    end

    Note over App,DBX: Token Format Details

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over DBX: Token Request Format
        Note over DBX: POST https://{workspace}/oidc/v1/token
        Note over DBX: Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
        Note over DBX: Authorization: Basic {base64(client_id:client_secret)}
        Note over DBX: Body: grant_type=client_credentials&scope=all-apis
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over DBX: Token Response Format
        Note over DBX: { "access_token": "eyJraWQ...",
        Note over DBX:   "token_type": "Bearer",
        Note over DBX:   "expires_in": 3600 }
    end
